It calls the service behind the MyVoltalis app and web site
(https://api.myvoltalis.com) with the e-mail and the password of the user's
MyVoltalis account. Voltalis publishes no documentation for it. Voltalis and
MyVoltalis are trademarks of Voltalis SA; this integration is not affiliated
with nor endorsed by Voltalis.

Protocol knowledge
------------------
The routes, the fields of the answers and the way a manual setting is written
come from three community projects for Home Assistant, all under the MIT
License:
  - voltalis-homeassistant by ppaglier
    (https://github.com/ppaglier/voltalis-homeassistant);
  - ha-voltalis by Johann Delahayes
    (https://github.com/jdelahayes/ha-voltalis);
  - the Voltalis bridge of ha-addons by Zao Soula
    (https://github.com/zaosoula/ha-addons).
The answer to wrong credentials (401,
"backend.error.subscriber.badcredentials") was checked against the API itself.
No code was copied from these projects: this integration is an independent
JavaScript implementation of the same API.
